OL,5,G0306 Outlook
OL,6,     FIt can be hard to confront your
OL,7,     Fdad - especially if it's about his
OL,8,     Fsubstance abuse. Grace Harper
OL,9,     FBrighouse used her camera and the
OL,10,     Fexcuse of a dying dog to really
OL,11,     Funderstand him.
OL,12,G0350 Witness History
OL,13,     FIn 1970, Washoe the chimp was
OL,14,     Frecognised as the first non-human
OL,15,     Fto learn a human language. She was
OL,16,     Ftaught American sign language in a
OL,17,     Frevolutionary and controversial
OL,18,     Fexperiment.
